  "id": "2026-11-23-fa-local-blocks-and-unknown-telemetry",
  "problem_type": "Reference delivery and failure evidence across generation boundaries",
  "symptom": "The release radar reports 17 locally blocked video failures and 18 locally blocked image failures on 0.24, 27 image failures on one installation and 557 unknown reasons across versions.",
  "direct_cause": "The reference probe treats request-specific HTTP failures as a dead source. The Run substitutes a generic sentence for most terminal reasons. Task IPC drops the vendor category carried by an adapter cause. Renderer retry policy read timeout-like prose even when dispatch evidence already closed the attempt.",
  "class_root": "The source, adapter and Run each have evidence about one operation. Their consumers turn an incomplete observation into a new decision and discard the evidence needed by later consumers.",
  "affected_population": [
    "Creators sending image and video references, inspecting a restored Run or receiving an adapter failure."
  ],
  "scope_paths": [
    "electron/assets/providerMediaFetch.ts",
    "electron/productionRun/productionGenerationSubmission.ts",
    "electron/productionRun/productionGenerationMaterialization.ts",
    "electron/tasks/taskIpcGuard.ts",
    "src/workbench/generationCanvas/runner/generationRetryPolicy.ts"
  ],
  "entry_points": [
    "Mapped generation, custom call, reference seal, rework, mapping trial and assistant model trial use the reference transport.",
    "Workbench and canvas use task IPC and the same generation outcome reporter. Canvas and catalog jobs share the Run journal.",
    "Single image and video intents, batch and wave runners share the renderer retry predicate."
  ],
  "external_sources": [],
  "internal_only_reason": "The decision concerns internal generation evidence, the released versions and the creator ruling of 2026-11-13. Loopback HTTP and production serializers reproduce the behaviors without an external service.",
  "invariants": [
    "A range probe may select replacement upload only on evidence the reference is unavailable. Request-specific rejection can still accompany a readable original.",
    "On a failed poll, persist the already-classified vendor category, status and safe code for the next Run reader.",
    "Carry the classified provider facts across task IPC, including a transparent catalog adapter wrapper. Outer dispatch evidence retains priority.",
    "One machine-classified local refusal yields one renderer executor invocation per intent."
  ],
